{"id":14908831169,"name":"ROCKS [ALPHA]","desc":"[😎] rock game? rock people? rock pets? no way!\n\n[🪨] Stack rocks on your head, throw them, sell them, and use your money to level up your character and explore new, diverse, and exciting areas!\n\n[👍] Remember to like the game, it helps a lot!\n[💸] Use code: \"fiveBigOnes\" for an extra 5,000 Money at the start of the game!\n[☁️!Update 22!☁️] Use code: \"veryhungry\" for a 10 minute potion effect!\n\n[💫] Join the group for updates on new codes and features!\n\n[🐛] Game is in development, if you encounter any bugs, send a message to the group owner.","path":"/game/14908831169-rocks-alpha","slug":"14908831169-rocks-alpha","thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/24a1f956b0e459de38efab8978680d1a8506067ed9ddb4d160cf8a5d12710935.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-a38301a916c5ed556ef51d780dc008be/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":0,"visitor":6634919,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2024-07-08T02:34:56.951Z","creator":{"name":"Project: 1","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":2,"freeCount":2,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":1},"page":1,"next":null,"total":1,"scripts":[{"slug":"ROCKS-ALPHA-inf-money-15400","_id":"668b5050feca0985524779d3","title":"infinite money","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c78121","gameId":14908831169,"name":"ROCKS [ALPHA]","imageUrl":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-game.webp","original":null},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-game.webp","original":null},"placeId":14908831169},"features":"i lied not infinite money but basically infinite money, how to use:\n1: pickup rock(s)\ndone\nhow to stop: throw rock(s)\n\nDOESNT WORK ON SOLARA!!","tags":[],"script":"local rs = game:GetService(\"RunService\")\ngetgenv().rocks = {}\nlocal hook;hook = hookmetamethod(game, \"__namecall\", function(self, ...)\n    local args = {...}\n    if not checkcaller() and getnamecallmethod() == \"FireServer\" then\n        if tostring(self) == \"PickupReplicate\" then\n            getgenv().rocks[#getgenv().rocks+1] = rs.Stepped:Connect(function()\n                game:GetService(\"ReplicatedStorage\").Remotes.RockCollect:FireServer(args[2])\n            end)\n        elseif tostring(self) == \"ThrowReplicate\" then\n            getgenv().rocks[1]:Disconnect()\n            table.remove(getgenv().rocks, 1)\n            --[[ if your game gets to laggy and your unable to through your whole stack:\n                for _,rock in pairs(getgenv().rocks) do\n                    rock:Disconnect()\n                end\n            ]]\n        end\n    end\n    return hook(self, ...)\nend)","owner":{"_id":"630d86359541ae5f4eaeb204","username":"SkireScripts","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/0a1a427ffb767435bf427d864b1ea467d292350f40c5bbad81c6194478bb5824.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/630d86359541ae5f4eaeb204-1742286952028.png"},"status":"offline","id":"630d86359541ae5f4eaeb204","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.followers","tier":10},"profile":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/0a1a427ffb767435bf427d864b1ea467d292350f40c5bbad81c6194478bb5824.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/630d86359541ae5f4eaeb204-1742286952028.png"}},"verified":false,"keyLink":"","views":10958,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":false,"isPatched":true,"visibility":"public","createdAt":"2024-07-08T02:34:56.951Z","dislikeCount":1,"likeCount":5,"image":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-script.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/b54d13d0fb88fb9a11d50d4b18711d01/500/280/Image/Jpeg","scriptblox":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/b54d13d0fb88fb9a11d50d4b18711d01/500/280/Image/Jpeg"},"executes":12,"keyless":false,"liked":false,"disliked":false,"cstatus":{"verdict":"none","pct":null,"conf":0,"n":{"w":0,"b":0,"p":0,"d":0,"k":0},"total":0,"detected":false,"key":false,"recent":0,"at":"2026-10-14T04:45:23.805Z"},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-script.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/b54d13d0fb88fb9a11d5